    "innovation": "This paper provides statistical evidence for human influence on climate by using Granger causality to demonstrate a south-to-north causal order in hemispheric temperature records, a pattern attributed to the combined effects of anthropogenic greenhouse gases and geographically concentrated tropospheric sulphate aerosols.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
