            "paragraph": "We analyse results generated by the Hadley Centre climate model (HCCM) because it simulates three experiments that vary the spatial and temporal pattern of all greenhouse gases and tropo- spheric sulphates; the control experiment, the greenhouse gas (GHG) experiment, and the SUL experiment8.",
