            "paragraph": "We analyse results generated by the Hadley Centre climate model (HCCM) because it simulates three experiments that vary the spatial and temporal pattern of all greenhouse gases and tropo- spheric sulphates; the control experiment, the greenhouse gas (GHG) experiment, and the SUL experiment8. The SUL experiment adds the effect of tropospheric sulphates to the effect of greenhouse gases.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
